  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 5 year rows (昭和 4-8) + 53 in 地方別 (總數(內地), 47 道府縣, 朝鮮, 臺灣, 樺太, 關東州及滿鐵附屬地, 南洋) as printed. The table runs across the whole spread (pp. 302-303); the title is split over the two pages (犯罪檢 / 擧件數) and the 刑法犯 / 罪名 headings are carried across; both halves are joined into one row by row label.",
   "The printed 道府縣 serial numbers 1-47 appear on both pages (before the name on the left, at the edge on the right); the left ones are not written in the row label; the right-edge number is kept in the last column '年次・地方番號' (year rows carry 4-8 there; the 總數 row and the colonies have none, the colonies' names are repeated vertically at the right edge).",
   "Row-wise checks (python): 刑法犯總數 = sum of the 20 offence columns, and 總數 = 刑法犯總數 + 陸海軍刑法犯 + 警察犯處罰令 (2 cols) + 廳府縣令違犯 + 其他ノ法令違犯, reconcile for every row, including all 47 道府縣, 朝鮮, 臺灣, 樺太 (with ×358 included), 關東州 and 南洋; only 昭和 5 differs (see below).",
   "Merged cells (printed with braces): 朝鮮 43,111, 關東州及滿鐵附屬地 21,613 and 南洋 853 each span the five columns 陸海軍刑法犯 … 其他ノ法令違犯 and are written in 陸海軍刑法犯 with the other four cells empty. 南洋 殺人罪及同未遂 / 傷害罪同致死罪及暴行罪 share one cell 48 (written in 殺人罪及同未遂, 傷害 empty). 南洋 竊盜罪 / 强盜罪 share one cell 408 (written in 竊盜罪, 强盜罪 empty).",
   "樺太: the cell under 警察犯處罰令 — 省令ニテ定メタル is printed '× 358' (× = 特別法犯 per the footnote); written '× 358'.",
   "臺灣: 刑法犯 detail printed as … for all offences except 竊盜罪 16,166, 强盜罪 64, 詐欺背任恐喝罪 7,992 and 橫領罪 5,947; right-hand columns … ; 總數 30,169 = 刑法犯 總數 30,169.",
   "Row '昭和 5', col '刑法犯 — 住居ヲ侵ス罪': last digit clipped in print ('7,60?'); cell is [?]. With the other cells as read, 7,603 would make the parts exceed the printed 刑法犯 總數 1,027,090 by 1 and 7,602 would reconcile — not used.",
   "Row '昭和 8' equals the printed 總數(內地) row in all columns.",
   "Small headings: '通貨文書有價證券印章僞造ノ罪' and '過失傷害罪同致死罪及業務上過失傷害罪' are printed in very small type and read from enlarged crops."
  ],
